OL,3,GNEWSARazor wire installed to keep
OL,4,Amansion intruders out
OL,5,
OL,6,FRazor wire has been installed around
OL,7,Fparts of a crumbling mansion to stop
OL,8,Fvandals as work continues on a
OL,9,Fmultimillion-pound effort to save it.
OL,11,FThe extra security measures have been
OL,12,Fput in place at Oldway Mansion in
OL,13,FPaignton, Devon, one of Torbay's most
OL,14,Fimportant historic buildings, after a
OL,15,Fnumber of break-ins at the landmark,
OL,16,Fformer home of the Singer sewing
OL,17,Fmachine family.
OL,19,FThe Grade II* listed mansion is
OL,20,Fundergoing the first phase of a #9m
OL,21,Frestoration to stabilise and
OL,22,Fweatherproof the building.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
