OL,3,GNEWSARazor wire installed to keep
OL,4,Amansion intruders out
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlan Denby, Torbay Council's director
OL,7,Fof pride in place, told Torbay Place
OL,8,FLeadership Board: "Razor wire may not
OL,9,Fbe to everyone's tastes, but there are
OL,10,Fa huge amount of things that could go
OL,11,Fwrong."
